spec: S17-02, S17-03, S17-04, S17-05, S17-08

Ticket 17 — two checkouts of one Document (`cc-plan`): Rowan's in the sandbox, @scribe's in
`agent/`. The agent pushes v2; Rowan's push from v1 is refused with the missing hunk (non-TTY,
TTY, `--json`); he puts it in and the same push is a normal v3. The agent's checkout, never
pulled and unedited, is refused too (a stale file never reverts the head) until it says
`--discard-head-changes`, which the event log records (`wait`: `discarding v3`). Merged
stdout+stderr; ids and seqs are random.

```console
$ annotary -p rowan push cc-plan.md -m "first draft"
cc-plan	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p agent pull cc-plan --out agent
pull: 0 threads, 0 assets
cc-plan.md	cc-plan.annotary	v1

$ sh agent-edit.sh
1

$ annotary -p agent push agent/cc-plan.md -m "storage: WAL"
cc-plan	[..]	v2

$ sh rowan-edit.sh
1

$ annotary -p rowan push cc-plan.md -m "later"
? 5
error: v2 by @scribe changed cc-plan.md since your v1 — those changes are not in your file — put them into cc-plan.md and push again
@@ -1,7 +1,8 @@
 # Plan
 
 ## Storage
-SQLite, one file.
+SQLite, one file, WAL mode.
+Blobs are content-addressed.
 
 ## API
 REST over HTTP.

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan push cc-plan.md -m "later"
? 5
error: v2 by @scribe changed cc-plan.md since your v1 — those changes are not in your file — put them into cc-plan.md and push again
@@ -1,7 +1,8 @@
 # Plan
 
 ## Storage
-SQLite, one file.
+SQLite, one file, WAL mode.
+Blobs are content-addressed.
 
 ## API
 REST over HTTP.

$ annotary -p rowan push cc-plan.md --json
? 5
{"error":"head_moved","message":"v2 by @scribe changed cc-plan.md since your v1 — those changes are not in your file","hint":"put them into cc-plan.md and push again","base":1,"head":2,"by":["scribe"],"missing":[{"hunk":"@@ -1,7 +1,8 @@","lines":[" # Plan"," "," ## Storage","-SQLite, one file.","+SQLite, one file, WAL mode.","+Blobs are content-addressed."," "," ## API"," REST over HTTP."]}],"assets":[]}

$ sh rowan-merge.sh
1

$ annotary -p rowan push cc-plan.md -m "later"
cc-plan	[..]	v3

$ annotary -p agent push agent/cc-plan.md
? 5
error: v3 by @rowan changed agent/cc-plan.md since your v2 — those changes are not in your file — put them into agent/cc-plan.md and push again
@@ -8,4 +8,4 @@
 REST over HTTP.
 
 ## Later
-Nothing yet.
+Search, later.

$ annotary -p agent push agent/cc-plan.md -m "revert" --discard-head-changes
warning: discarding v3 by @rowan since your v2
cc-plan	[..]	v4 (same content as v2)

$ annotary -p agent wait cc-plan --cursor 0 --on version --timeout 1s
[..]	version	cc-plan	v1 by @rowan "first draft"
[..]	version	cc-plan	v2 by @scribe "storage: WAL"
[..]	version	cc-plan	v3 by @rowan "later"
[..]	version	cc-plan	v4 by @scribe discarding v3 "revert"

```
